longdesc The author tells us: This is "a package with symbols prepared
longdesc with TikZ. These symbols are the variables used in the space of
longdesc the collapse of the wave function of a quantum field associated
longdesc with the micro-tubule while exploring an Orchestrated,
longdesc objective reduction (Orch OR) theory of consciousness as
longdesc applied to the three brains model of psychological experience."
